          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">its length along the edge of the Mongolian steppe; the Ming brick walls and watchtowers near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/beijing">Beijing</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shanhai-pass">Shanhai Pass</a>, the “First Pass Under Heaven”; Jiayu Pass at its western end; its election as one of the New 7 Wonders of the World; the myth that it can be seen from the Moon</span></div>
